5,1,1,talk,Servas,,"It is a pleasure to be sharing this home with you all. To ensure we find a harmony that suits everyone, I will look into the sunlight and heating need by room and the winter habits at a house paying ahead.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Midori,,I want to make sure we're all on the same page and feeling good about this. I'll look into the payment log for the last twelve months and the trial run of a reconciliation template.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to learn how we can make this fair for everyone. I'll look into the last twelve utility statements and the settling up when the last rooms filled.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I'm all for a system that keeps us happy! I'll check the payment log for the last twelve months and the electrician's quote for the rooms to see where we stand.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I want to make sure the process isn't too hard for whoever does it. I'll look into the monthly settle observed at another house and the trial run of a reconciliation template.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
