12,1,2,talk,Minato,,"I wonder if there are other things we should consider, but I think these two will help me understand how things were done before.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,"I'm curious if we're missing anything, but I think getting a handle on the actual costs and the setup fees is the best place to start. Let's see what we find!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I just hope we can find a way that doesn't put too much pressure on anyone. I'll stick with my choices.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Servas,,It is wise to be thorough. I believe understanding the physical needs of our rooms and the habits of others will guide us toward a compassionate agreement. I am content with my choices.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Midori,,I agree. I think it's important to look at the history of our payments to see if there are any patterns or tensions we should address. I'm looking forward to seeing what we discover.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Minato,,"I hope we can all be happy with the result. I'm a bit nervous, but I think looking at the old statements will show us how the bills have changed as more people moved in.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,I'm feeling good about this! I'll just stick with the payment log and the electrician's quote. I want to see the real numbers before we jump into anything too fancy.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
