35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"It is fascinating to see how the sun treats our rooms differently. Some of us may feel the chill much sooner than others, which is a quiet burden to carry alone.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Midori,,"Looking at the payment log, it seems there have been some delays and confusion over the amounts lately. I'm worried that the way we handle money might be causing some unspoken tension between us.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The statements show that the bills change a lot every month. One month was very high and another was low. It seems like the cost isn't always the same, which might be confusing.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"Minato is right! The bills are all over the place—February was nearly 30,000 yen while August was under 10,000. It's a total rollercoaster, which makes it impossible to budget properly.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I looked into the other house and the template. It seems like the actual work of calculating everything takes a lot of time... and it looks really tedious to do every month.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Daisuke, it is true that tedious work can weigh on the spirit. However, we must be careful not to let the desire for ease blind us to the needs of the heart and the home.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@Daisuke, I completely understand. If the process is too exhausting, it might make us resent the person doing the work. We need a balance between being precise and keeping things simple for everyone's sake.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"I also worry about that. I found out that when the last rooms were filled, it took a long time to agree on the costs. I don't want anyone to feel sad or upset about the money.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, we definitely don't want any drama! But we can't ignore the cost of fixing it. I checked the electrician's quote, and putting in sub-meters would cost 34,000 yen per room. That's a huge upfront hit!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I agree with Midori. If it's too much work, someone will end up struggling in silence. The template I tried was really hard... you have to enter every single invoice one by one. It seems like a lot.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a gentle reminder that our home is more than a ledger of costs. If we only seek the easiest path, we may overlook those who shiver in the shadows of the north rooms.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Servas, you're right that we should be compassionate. But I'm also worried that the delays I saw in the payment log are signs of frustration. If we don't fix the root cause, the atmosphere in the house will suffer.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"I think Midori is right. If people are frustrated, it might be because they feel the current way isn't fair. I want us to find a way where nobody feels like they are paying for someone else.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, I'm with you on fairness, but let's be real—fairness isn't free. If we want total precision, we're looking at a massive bill from the electrician. Is that really a ""win"" for our wallets right now?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I don't want us to spend too much money, but I'm really worried about the time. If we choose a complex system, the person in charge will spend their whole evening on it... and that doesn't seem fair either.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,"Let us remember that the warmth of a home comes not just from the heater, but from the kindness we show one another. We must speak openly about our needs now, lest we find ourselves cold in February.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I agree, Servas. Openness is key. I'm concerned that we've been smoothing over these issues, but the payment delays suggest that money is already affecting how we treat each other. We need a system that is both fair and sustainable.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Minato,,"I hope we can all be honest with each other. If some people feel they are carrying others, it's better to talk about it now so we can all feel peaceful and happy in our home.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"Exactly! But let's not forget that ""peaceful"" also means not having a sudden financial crisis. Between the wild monthly swings and the cost of sub-meters, we need a solution that doesn't break the bank.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
54,2,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
55,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I just want us to be happy. But if the system is too complicated, I'm afraid someone will just suffer through it without saying anything. I think we should prioritize something simple.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
56,2,4,pass,Daisuke,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
